  "description": "Real NGINX-vs-Jul migration E2E fixture (#365) precisely characterizing proxy_pass URI-rewriting semantics: nginx strips the matched location prefix and replaces it with the proxy_pass path, while Jul's proxy (net/http/httputil.ProxyRequest.SetURL) always prepends the proxy_pass path to the client's full incoming request path without stripping anything first.",
